-  <h3>Claude → Codex (<code>codex exec</code>, run from Claude Code)</h3>
-  <p>Direction added in revision 7. Staffing forbids <code>claude -p</code> from the Claude side, so the wrapper here is a native Agent subagent, pinned to the Claude-side floor model, running bounded <code>codex exec</code>. Two consecutive runs were byte-identical (exit 0, ~9 s each).</p>
