-      <tr id="smoke-c2c-bounded-route"><td>External route is bounded and non-interactive</td><td class="yes"><strong>Pass</strong></td><td><code>codex exec --model gpt-5.6-sol --sandbox read-only</code>, <code>perl</code>-alarm 120 s bound, stdin <code>&lt;/dev/null</code>; exit 0, no timeout.</td></tr>
