-      <tr id="smoke-c2c-wrapper-model"><td>Cheapest floor-valid native wrapper model is selected and proven</td><td class="yes"><strong>Pass</strong></td><td>Relay pinned to the <code>sonnet</code> floor via the Agent <code>model</code> param; subagent self-reported <code>wrapper_model=claude-sonnet-5</code>. External task model also selected and echoed (<code>-m</code> → <code>model_alias=gpt-5.6-sol</code>).</td></tr>
